w with Miro Hrončok (churchyard)", "id": 34774, "title": "FESCo election: Interview with Miro Hrončok (churchyard)", "slug": "fesco-election-interview-with-miro-hroncok-churchyard", "posts_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "highest_post_number": 1, "image_url": null, "created_at": "2021-11-25T23:50:27.814Z", "last_posted_at": "2021-11-25T23:50:27.910Z", "bumped": true, "bumped_at": "2021-11-25T23:50:27.910Z", "archetype": "regular", "unseen": false, "pinned": false, "unpinned": null, "visible": true, "closed": false, "archived": false, "bookmarked": null, "liked": null, "tags": [], "tags_descriptions": {}, "like_count": 1, "views": 276, "category_id": 61, "featured_link": null, "op_like_count": 1, "has_accepted_answer": false, "posters": [{"extras": "latest single", "description": "Original Poster, Most Recent Poster", "user": {"id": 347, "username": "churchyard", "name": "Miro Hrončok", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/churchyard/{size}/35063_2.png", "flair_name": "council", "flair_url": "https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/original/2X/3/312b3d4695e3ffa99ceffdbbf5c1f78b7560de47.png", "flair_group_id": 43, "primary_group_name": "council", "trust_level": 2}}]}, {"fancy_title": "FESCo election: Interview with David Cantrell", "id": 44713, "title": "FESCo election: Interview with David Cantrell", "slug": "fesco-election-interview-with-david-cantrell", "posts_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "highest_post_number": 1, "image_url": null, "created_at": "2022-12-08T23:50:16.878Z", "last_posted_at": "2022-12-08T23:50:16.981Z", "bumped": true, "bumped_at": "2022-12-08T23:50:16.981Z", "archetype": "regular", "unseen": false, "pinned": false, "unpinned": null, "visible": true, "closed": false, "archived": false, "bookmarked": null, "liked": null, "tags": [], "tags_descriptions": {}, "like_count": 0, "views": 231, "category_id": 61, "featured_link": null, "op_like_count": 0, "has_accepted_answer": false, "posters": [{"extras": "latest single", "descri